source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A titled link whose visible text is its target is written with the target twice; Jira shows the target as the link text.
-- input.jira --
[http://x|http://x|t]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="t" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[http://x](http://x "t")
-- warnings.json --
[]
